content:
Help me find the associations.  

#### Data:
These are the extracted domain objects and their associations:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Pet Owner",
      "description": "Person who requests and pays for pet sitting services"
    },
    {
      "name": "Pet Care Request",
      "description": "Request describing how a pet should be cared for during a time period",
      "attributes": [
        "Pet",
        "Time Period",
        "Care Instructions"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Pet",
      "description": "Animal that requires care"
    },
    {
      "name": "Time Period",
      "description": "Span of time during which care is needed"
    },
    {
      "name": "Care Instructions",
      "description": "Details about feeding, walking, or medication needs"
    },
    {
      "name": "Pet Sitter",
      "description": "Person who performs the pet care visit"
    },
    {
      "name": "Update Log",
      "description": "Record of updates the sitter sends during a visit"
    },
    {
      "name": "Schedule Coordination",
      "description": "Coordination process for handling overlapping or shared schedules"
    },
    {
      "name": "Care Report",
      "description": "Summary of the pet’s activities and behavior after a visit"
    },
    {
      "name": "Coordinator",
      "description": "Person who manages bookings and sitter assignments"
    },
    {
      "name": "Booking",
      "description": "Confirmed arrangement between owner, sitter, and request"
    },
    {
      "name": "Payment",
      "description": "Transaction made by the owner to complete the booking"
    },
    {
      "name": "Reminder",
      "description": "Notification sent about an upcoming booking",
      "attributes": [
        "Booking"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

#### Task:
- Draw connections between objects that have an association. 
- Name each object and add a description that captures the meaning of the association.
- Return the associations in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "...",
      "to": "...",
      "description": "..."
    }
  ]
}
```

Here are the associations:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "Pet Owner",
      "to": "Pet Care Request",
      "description": "Pet Owner creates a Pet Care Request"
    },
    {
      "from": "Coordinator",
      "to": "Pet Care Request",
      "description": "Coordinator reviews and manages the Pet Care Request"
    },
    {
      "from": "Coordinator",
      "to": "Booking",
      "description": "Coordinator sets up a Booking"
    },
    {
      "from": "Booking",
      "to": "Pet Care Request",
      "description": "Booking references the related Pet Care Request"
    },
    {
      "from": "Booking",
      "to": "Pet Sitter",
      "description": "Booking assigns a Pet Sitter"
    },
    {
      "from": "Coordinator",
      "to": "Schedule Coordination",
      "description": "Coordinator initiates Schedule Coordination"
    },
    {
      "from": "Pet Sitter",
      "to": "Schedule Coordination",
      "description": "Pet Sitter participates in Schedule Coordination"
    },
    {
      "from": "Pet Sitter",
      "to": "Update Log",
      "description": "Pet Sitter creates an Update Log"
    },
    {
      "from": "Update Log",
      "to": "Pet Owner",
      "description": "Update Log informs the Pet Owner"
    },
    {
      "from": "Pet Sitter",
      "to": "Care Report",
      "description": "Pet Sitter writes the Care Report"
    },
    {
      "from": "Care Report",
      "to": "Pet Care Request",
      "description": "Care Report describes the Pet Care Request outcome"
    },
    {
      "from": "Pet Owner",
      "to": "Payment",
      "description": "Pet Owner issues the Payment"
    },
    {
      "from": "Payment",
      "to": "Booking",
      "description": "Payment completes the Booking"
    },
    {
      "from": "Coordinator",
      "to": "Reminder",
      "description": "Coordinator sends a Reminder"
    },
    {
      "from": "Reminder",
      "to": "Pet Sitter",
      "description": "Reminder notifies the Pet Sitter"
    },
    {
      "from": "Reminder",
      "to": "Pet Owner",
      "description": "Reminder notifies the Pet Owner"
    }
  ]
}
```
